{"id":"a691a8cf95f38f20","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-pointwise-bound.md","title":"Pointwise Bound","display":"df-pointwise-bound — Pointwise Bound","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pointwise-bound","aliases":["58-df-pointwise-bound","Pointwise Bound"],"display":"df-pointwise-bound — Pointwise Bound","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[./58-df-function-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pointwise-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pointwise-bound</span><span>Pointwise Bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pointwise-bound — Pointwise Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa82947fba077a45\" href=\"?note=aa82947fba077a45\" title=\"./58-df-function-set.md\">58-df-function-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V,\\quad f\\in\\mathbb C^X,\\quad g\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^X\">\\(X\\in V,\\quad f\\in\\mathbb C^X,\\quad g\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty:V\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty:V\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PointwiseBounded}_S,\\operatorname{UniformlyBounded}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{PointwiseBounded}_S,\\operatorname{UniformlyBounded}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}norm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\to\n\\left(\\|f\\|_\\infty\\coloneqq\\sup\\{|f(x)|:x\\in X\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}norm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\to\n\\left(\\|f\\|_\\infty\\coloneqq\\sup\\{|f(x)|:x\\in X\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S(f,g,X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(|f(x)|\\leq g(x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S(f,g,X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(|f(x)|\\leq g(x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S(f,g,X)\\to \\|f\\|_\\infty \\leq \\|g\\|_\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S(f,g,X)\\to \\|f\\|_\\infty \\leq \\|g\\|_\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBounded}_S(\\mathcal{F},X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists M_x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;(|f(x)| \\leq M_x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBounded}_S(\\mathcal{F},X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists M_x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;(|f(x)| \\leq M_x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniformly\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{UniformlyBounded}_S(\\mathcal{F},X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;\\forall x \\in X\\;(|f(x)| \\leq M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniformly\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{UniformlyBounded}_S(\\mathcal{F},X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;\\forall x \\in X\\;(|f(x)| \\leq M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The supremum norm used by the domination consequence is defined from the declared function domain rather than left as an opaque operator.</li>\n<li>Pointwise bound: at each point, comparison holds individually; no uniform constant</li>\n<li>Arzelà-Ascoli: equicontinuous + pointwise bounded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> precompact in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(X)\">\\(C(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Uniform bound: supremum norm finite; stronger than pointwise bounded</li>\n<li>Norm domination: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|f| \\leq g\">\\(|f| \\leq g\\)</span> pointwise <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|f\\|_p \\leq \\|g\\|_p\">\\(\\|f\\|_p \\leq \\|g\\|_p\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-function-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa82947fba077a45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-function-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V,\\quad f\\in\\mathbb C^X,\\quad g\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty:V\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PointwiseBounded}_S,\\operatorname{UniformlyBounded}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}norm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\to\n\\left(\\|f\\|_\\infty\\coloneqq\\sup\\{|f(x)|:x\\in X\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S(f,g,X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(|f(x)|\\leq g(x))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bound\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBound}_S(f,g,X)\\to \\|f\\|_\\infty \\leq \\|g\\|_\\infty","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointwiseBounded}_S(\\mathcal{F},X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists M_x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;(|f(x)| \\leq M_x)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniformly\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{UniformlyBounded}_S(\\mathcal{F},X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathbb C^X\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal{F}\\;\\forall x \\in X\\;(|f(x)| \\leq M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\implies","display":false},{"tex":"C(X)","display":false},{"tex":"|f| \\leq g","display":false},{"tex":"\\implies","display":false},{"tex":"\\|f\\|_p \\leq \\|g\\|_p","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false}],"bytes":2340,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872